### FEES & BULK IMPORT API COLLECTION
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Phụ huynh xem sao kê học phí con mình
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fees/statement/1
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### 2. Tạo đơn thanh toán Razorpay Sandbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fees/create-order
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "amount": 2000000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "receipt": "REC_TEST_001"
}

### 3. Xác thực thanh toán
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fees/verify-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpayOrderId": "order_test_123",
  "razorpayPaymentId": "pay_test_456",
  "razorpaySignature": "valid_hmac_signature_here",
  "studentId": 1,
  "amount": 2000000
}

### 4. Admin ghi nhận nộp tiền mặt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fees/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "amount": 1000000,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "remarks": "Thu tiền mặt trực tiếp"
}

### 5. Upload File Excel học sinh hợp lệ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/students
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="01-valid-students.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< /home/dotrongminh/Documents/CTY-GIAODUC-DAIVIET/Astra/Project-GD/qa/04-test-data/excel-samples/01-valid-students.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 6. Admin xem báo cáo đối soát Migration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/migration/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
